  "description": "Exposes this host's agent tools over the Model Context Protocol. Lists them per request through the same filters that gate the call, so a tool added by an upstream server or revoked for a caller is reflected without a restart. A tool is already a Microsoft.Extensions.AI AIFunction, so there is no adapter between the two models.",
